OL,3,GNEWSAWait goes on for more frequent
OL,4,ASunderland Metros
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to make Tyne and Wear Metro
OL,7,Ftrains more frequent have been partly
OL,8,Fdelayed.
OL,10,FEarlier this year, the rail operator
OL,11,FNexus and North East Mayor Kim
OL,12,FMcGuinness said the service's weekday
OL,13,Fdaytime frequency would rise from at
OL,14,Fleast every 12 minutes to every 10
OL,15,Fminutes in December.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
