OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWait goes on for more frequent
OL,4,ASunderland Metros
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a letter to Sunderland's
OL,7,Fcouncillors, Nexus's managing director
OL,8,FCathy Massarella said part of the
OL,9,Fservice from Pelaw to South Hylton
OL,10,Fwould not see that change until the
OL,11,Fspring due to "infrastructure upgrades
OL,12,Fand testing work" required.
OL,14,FLiberal Democrat councillor Julia Potts
OL,15,Fsaid it felt like Sunderland, where
OL,16,Fmost of the stations on that part of
OL,17,Fthe line are, was being treated as
OL,18,F"second best".
